      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "UdyrQ",
        "name": "Wilding Claw",
        "maxRank": 6,
        "summary": "Udyr gains attack speed and his next two attacks deal bonus physical damage. Recast: Gain even more attack speed, and the next two attacks call lightning to strike the target.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Claw Stance:</span> Udyr gains <span>20/32/44/56/68/80% Attack Speed</span> and his Attacks deal <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(6/12/18/24/30/36 + (20% bonus Attack Damage) + (1/1.2/1.4/1.6/1.8/2% bonus Health)) physical damage</span> <span>On-Hit</span> for 4 seconds. Additionally, Udyr's next two Attacks in this stance deal a bonus <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(3/4/5/6/7/8% + (3.5% per 100 bonus Attack Damage)) max Health physical damage</span> and gain 50 range.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Awaken:</span> Increase bonus <span>Attack Speed</span> to <span>20/32/44/56/68/80%</span> and max Health damage to <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(3/4/5/6/7/8% + (5% per 100 bonus Attack Damage) + (0.1% per 100 bonus Health))</span>. Additionally, Udyr's next two Attacks call lightning six times, dealing a total of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">? max Health magic damage</span> to isolated targets (strikes bounce to other nearby targets when possible).<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Claw Stance Max Health damage is capped at (15 + (50% Ability Power) + (100% bonus Attack Damage)) to monsters. Each lightning strike deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(0.6% per 100 Ability Power) max Health magic damage</span> Minimum damage to minions: (40 ~ 160)).</span>",
        "iconFile": "UdyrQ.png",
