      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "UdyrW",
        "name": "Iron Mantle",
        "maxRank": 6,
        "summary": "Udyr gains a shield and his next two attacks heal him. Recast: Gain an even bigger shield and heal based on max health over the next couple seconds.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Mantle Stance:</span> Udyr gains <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(45/65/85/105/125/145 + (2/2.3/2.6/2.9/3.2/3.5% Health) + (40% Ability Power) + (50% bonus Attack Damage)) Shield</span> for 4 seconds. Additionally, Udyr's next two Attacks gain 15/16/17/18/19/20% Life Steal and restore <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">((1.2% Health) + (8% Ability Power)) Health</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Awaken:</span> Gain <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(45/65/85/105/125/145 + (65% Ability Power) + (8% Health) + (100% bonus Attack Damage)) Shield</span>, restore <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(22.5/32.5/42.5/52.5/62.5/72.5 + (32.5% Ability Power) + (4% Health) + (50% bonus Attack Damage)) Health</span> over 4 seconds, and Udyr's next two Attacks instead have 30/32/34/36/38/40% Life Steal and restore <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">((2.4% Health) + (16% Ability Power)) Health</span>.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The Shield granted by an Awaken cast will stack with any remaining Shield from the original cast. Life on hit reduced by 40% against minions.</span>",
