      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "UdyrR",
        "name": "Wingborne Storm",
        "maxRank": 6,
        "summary": "Udyr surrounds himself in a glacial storm, damaging and slowing nearby enemies. Recast: Empower and unleash the storm, causing it to track enemies and deal additional damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Storm Stance:</span> Udyr surrounds himself in a glacial storm for 4 seconds, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(20/36/52/68/84/100 + (35% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per second to nearby enemies and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 15/18/21/24/27/30%. Additionally, Udyr's next two Attacks in this stance deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(35% Ability Power) magic damage</span> to enemies in the storm.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Awaken:</span> Unleash the storm, causing it to follow Udyr's last Attacked enemy, deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(3.5% per 100 Ability Power) max Health magic damage</span> over the duration, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> by an additional 5%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Storm deals 80% damage to minions. Awakened deals a minimum of (40 ~ 280) to monsters.</span>",
